<title>UK: Tepnel climbs on positive press comment.</title>
<headline>Tepnel climbs on positive press comment.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Tepnel Life Sciences Plc, a diagnostics research and development group, surged on Monday after positive press comment, market-makers said.</p>
<p>The Sunday Telegraph &quot;Taking Stock&quot; column said Tepnel was &quot;the next biotech hot stock&quot; and said talk of new products and partnerships could justify a share price of 250p by summer this year.  </p>
<p>The stock climbed 36p or 47.06 percent to 115p by  0845 GMT in volume of 1.1 million shares, having touched an intra-day high of 127p.</p>
<p>-- Tara FitzGerald, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
